<title>USA: First Data names exec VP of unit.</title>
<headline>First Data names exec VP of unit.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Investors Services Group, the mutual fund distribution and services subsidiary of First Data Corp, said Wednesday it has named Robert Hering executive vice president.</p>
<p>Hering will lead the company's distribution, marketing, strategic planning and product development initiatives, the company said.</p>
<p>Most recently, Hering was managing director of Furman Selz LLC, which is based in New York.</p>
